{"kind":"rss","id":"wxmp:channel:gh_a3bb8fead1f9","title":"电子数据取证与鉴定","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA4NTAzOTI4OA==&mid=2649978561&idx=1&sn=5bf7daf3cfa9021c62edc14647e7cb73&chksm=87d9d716b0ae5e001f99315b42522ffda59daf8b2be3d5cbd63e71df52d4e9496c54ab558d74&scene=126&sessionid=1795773496#rd","description":"介绍电子数据取证与鉴定的基础知识、法律法规、技术标准及检验方法、检验流程、取证和鉴定的工具等。","language":"zh-cn","extra":{"view":"timeline","show_thumbnails":true,"proxy_images":true,"headers":{"referer":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"tags":["微信公众号"]},"author":{"name":"电子数据取证与鉴定","uri":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx.qlogo.cn%2Fmmhead%2FQ3auHgzwzM45HZ1X6zMeXIGiaHSYjeiab6U2sP0Gq0MA9iczrBykwlVOQ%2F0","updated":"2019-08-19T15:46:52.000Z","items":[{"id":"wxmp:MzA4NTAzOTI4OA%3D%3D:2649978561:1","title":"第三十七期 电子数据鉴定的注意事项","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA4NTAzOTI4OA==&mid=2649978561&idx=1&sn=5bf7daf3cfa9021c62edc14647e7cb73&chksm=87d9d716b0ae5e001f99315b42522ffda59daf8b2be3d5cbd63e71df52d4e9496c54ab558d74&scene=126&sessionid=1795773496#rd","description":"作为新《刑事诉讼法》、《民事诉讼法》和《行政诉讼法》新增的法定证据种类，电子数据在各类诉讼中发挥着越来越重要的作用，成为挖掘案件真相的关键。本文将结合认证认可的要求分析一下电子数据鉴定过程中的注意事项。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FiajXloDFTYyguPy0TIu9spn69auHmXIXE1sNlrBZffhTFENWKBGvbeZE33jUCXp8PSdA2kJpcDuB1muqiaCgJrYw%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2019-08-19T15:46:52.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzA4NTAzOTI4OA%3D%3D:2649978554:1","title":"第三十六期 国内电子数据取证标准的最新进展","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA4NTAzOTI4OA==&mid=2649978554&idx=1&sn=2d2cb428ff9bb6db6a2feed4a34e31ab&chksm=87d9d76db0ae5e7b6ccbbbb097e243a37522a64af54945893570d15efce230a5771a8e0d8164&scene=126&sessionid=1795773496#rd","description":"近年来，随着国家对于相关标准工作的重视，电子数据取证的标准化工作发展迅速。2018年，电子数据取证又发布了一系列的标准和规范。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FiajXloDFTYyhJnssWIKFTfDBOYyr5yfE4X